CLASS:Knight of the Divine Hammer	HD:10	TYPE:Prestige.PC	STARTSKILLPTS:2	MAXLEVEL:10	CSKILL:TYPE=Craft|Diplomacy|Gather Information|Handle Animal|Intimidate|Knowledge (Nobility and Royalty)|Knowledge (Religion)|Ride|Sense Motive	BONUS:COMBAT|BASEAB|classlevel	BONUS:SAVE|Fort|CL/2+2	BONUS:SAVE|Ref|CL/3	BONUS:SAVE|Will|CL/3	AUTO:WEAPONPROF|TYPE=Simple|TYPE=Martial	AUTO:ARMORPROF|ARMORTYPE=Light|ARMORTYPE=Medium|ARMORTYPE=Heavy	AUTO:SHIELDPROF|SHIELDTYPE=Shield|SHIELDTYPE=Tower	DESC:An Istaran knighthood founded under Kingpriest Beldinas. Code of conduct (p.18): pay homage to Paladine daily, seek out and vanquish evil, obey a superior knight, show honor to honorable foes, and be ready to die for the greater good. A knight who grossly violates the code, stops being of a permitted alignment, willfully commits an evil act or takes a level in an arcane spellcasting class loses all special abilities until he atones (atonement; the Lord Marshal or Kingpriest must also accept him back, and an arcane caster must forsake that class's abilities too). Paladins may multiclass freely with this class.	PRETEXT:Served the Hammer as a squire for at least three months, sponsored by another knight, and kept a night's vigil and prayer to Paladine	PREALIGN:LG,LN,NG	PREBAB:5	PRESKILL:1,Handle Animal=2	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Religion)=4	PRESKILL:1,Ride=4	PRESKILL:1,Sense Motive=4	PREFEAT:1,Armor Proficiency (Heavy)	PREFEAT:1,Honor-Bound	PREFEAT:1,Negotiator	SOURCEPAGE:p.16-18
